---
import Section from './Section.astro';
import { path } from '../site';
---

<Section
  id="assistants"
  eyebrow="Agentic search"
  title="Searchable by AI agents"
  lead="Every site comes with its own MCP server. Connect Claude, ChatGPT or any other agent that speaks the Model Context Protocol, and it can search the collection on its own: run searches, follow similar objects, and link each answer to the object's page on your site."
>
  <p class="muted note">
    In apps that show interactive results, such as Claude, ChatGPT and VS Code, the answers appear as an image wall in the conversation. The server only reads and needs no account.
  </p>
  <p class="more"><a href={path('/docs/mcp-server/')}>Turn it on and connect an agent</a></p>
</Section>

<style>
  .note { max-width: 62ch; margin-bottom: 0.75em; }
  .more { margin: 0; }
</style>
